{"actor": "system", "cost_usd": 0.0, "event_type": "finalize", "latency_ms": 1.0, "payload": {"final_answer": "As of April 7, 2025, the current Chief Financial Officer (CFO) of Airbnb (NASDAQ: ABNB) is **Ellie Mertz** (also referred to as Elinor Mertz).\n\nShe officially succeeded Dave Stephenson as CFO on March 1, 2024, after having served as the company's Vice President of Finance for several years. She was most recently featured as CFO in Airbnb's Q4 2024 earnings call and shareholder letter released in February 2025.\n\nFINAL ANSWER: Ellie Mertz (Elinor Mertz)\n\n{\n    \"sources\": [\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/13/airbnb-abnb-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/\",\n            \"name\": \"The Motley Fool: Airbnb (ABNB) Q4 2024 Earnings Call Transcript\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/quotes/ABNB\",\n            \"name\": \"CNBC: ABNB: Airbnb Inc - Stock Price, Quote and News\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"url\": \"https://s26.q4cdn.com/656283129/files/doc_financials/2024/q4/Airbnb_Q4-2024-Shareholder-Letter_Final.pdf\",\n            \"name\": \"Airbnb Q4 2024 Shareholder Letter\"\n        }\n    ]\n}", "final_reason": "single_agent", "retrieved_docids": ["02", "13", "2024", "2025", "26", "4", "656283129"], "status": "completed", "success": true}, "state_id": "run_0_finalize", "timestamp_end": 1774525889.1432123, "timestamp_start": 1774525889.1422124, "token_in": 0, "token_out": 119}
